      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZEEZEA (5) made it back-to-back wins last start, scoring by 0.2L at the midweeks most recently. She's taken a liking to this track and trip and Galati reunites after guiding her to victory two back. In a purple patch of form and can continue her winning ways. SILENT DIVA (2) missed by 1.3L last start in a good return to form following a disappointing run the start prior. CJP sticks with her today and she maps to sit much closer in the run. Knocking on the door and can put it all together today. COSMIC WALTZ (8) hasn't been far away all campaign, missing narrowly when up on the speed here last time out, missing by 0.8L over the mile. Back in trip today and a good map ticks plenty of boxes. Can play a leading role. BELAURA STAR (4) is better than he showed last time out and an inside draw is a big tick. Can bounce back. ALLENTOWN (3) won't be far away.",
